<title>THAILAND: National Petro to pay 1.00 baht 1996 div.</title>
<headline>National Petro to pay 1.00 baht 1996 div.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>    Div (baht)	  1.00  vs  0.75</p>
<p>    Ex-dividend	 March 10, 1997</p>
<p>    Payment date	April 24, 1997</p>
<p>Note: Company's full name is National Petrochemical Plc, a petrochemical firm.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662-2529950)</p>
